    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633180/extras/2f1e4fe7737c617366bea4acf06a7e8a.avif?t=1747423393\" width=610 height=260 /></span><br><br>Info:<br>Duration: about 3h<br>Languages: English, Polish<br>Type: visual novel<br><br><strong>Bloody Good Friends</strong> is a touching visual novel about Mirian, who's only desire is to spend time with her friends during class. What's the worst that could happen?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633180/extras/c506061c6fc44e04d667ef25489775c4.poster.avif?t=1747423393\" width=610 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633180/extras/c506061c6fc44e04d667ef25489775c4.webm?t=1747423393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Shi, Yakedo i Yami</strong> \u2013 Mirian's best friends. Learn about their characters, interests, future plans and dreams. Spend time with them during lessons and meal breaks. Discover why their pack is probably the most harmonious team in the whole world!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633180/extras/Postaci_1.PNG?t=1747423393\" width=610 height=343 /></span><br><br><strong>Dan</strong> although he was part of the best friends' pack, he always stood a bit on the sidelines.<br><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Beautifully drawn characters and backgrounds.<br></li><li>Dialogues containing deep thoughts, telling a story with a little twist.<br></li><li>Fascinating characters with unique characters and stories.<br></li><li>Engaging group relationships.<br></li><li>Beautiful music. </li></ul><br><strong>Warning:</strong>.<br>The game contains descriptions and images that may be violent and execrable, not intended for minors. Please decide if you surely want to play.",
